    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS... are delighted to present this unique and spacious three bedroom terraced home to the open market spanning approx. 95 sq mtrs / 1,023 sq ft. No 26 offers its lucky new owners an ideal retreat from the hustle and bustle of city life living on the city's doorstep. This is an extremely attractive property that's superbly positioned on Clonturk Park.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of a welcoming hallway that leads to the front living area, living/dining room and kitchen area. Upstairs consists of three bedrooms and a family bathroom. The garden is lawned with lane access and there is off street parking to the front. The much-anticipated release of this property to the market represents a rare opportunity to purchase a substantial family home set in a well-established Dublin location. It is hard to believe such a peaceful area is so close to the city centre and so convenient to most things a couple or family might need.\r\n\r\nThe location of Number 26 is situated within a stone's throw of Drumcondra village with all local amenities on your doorstep. Third level colleges, Dublin City University and St Patrick's Teacher Training College are within easy walking distance. Trinity College Dublin and University College Dublin are both on direct bus routes.\r\n\r\nLocal national schools include, Corpus Christi National School , Scoil Mobhi, St Patrick's National School and Grace Park Educate Together. Secondary schools are within walking distance are Scoil Caitriona, Holy Faith Secondary Schools, Dominican College, Rosmini and Clonturk along with a variety of local sports clubs including Na Fíanna GAA Club, Clontarf Golf Club and Tolka Park Shelbourne FC. For lazy weekend brunches, lunch and dinner Anderson's Café, Shouk Restaurant are only a 15 minute stroll away. For those travelling further afield the M50, M1 and Dublin Airport are only a short stroll away.\r\n\r\nTo appreciate all this wonderful home has to offer please contact MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS - 01 8844690."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\n4.59m x 2.14m\r\n\r\nFront Living Room\r\n4.16m x 3.80m\r\n\r\nDining/Living Area\r\n4.06m x 3.79m\r\n\r\nKitchen Area\r\n2.77m x 2.14m\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n4.75m x 3.78m \r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.47m x 3.12m\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.92m x 2.14m\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.46m x 1.90m\r\n\r\nLanding\r\n2.44m x 3.76m\r\n\r\n** Overall area approx. 95 sq. mtrs **\r\n**Please note all measurements and floor plans are approximate and provided for guidance only**\r\n\r\nAll information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to ourselves. While every care is taken in preparing particulars the firm do not hold themselves responsible for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get a professional opinion on any concern they may have"
